Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:03.60,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 多伦多 WTA1000 第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:03.60,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}萨巴伦卡 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 6-3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 内岛萌夏 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Aryna,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:02.52,EN,,0,0,0,,great to have you back here in Toronto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:02.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,很高兴你回到多伦多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and you had to be at your best tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚你必须拿出最好的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:05.74,EN,,0,0,0,,a tough opening round match for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,首场就是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.06,EN,,0,0,0,,but you're through, how do you assess
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你过关了 你怎么评价
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.78,EN,,0,0,0,,your performance after tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚自己的表现？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not an easy match, after a little break,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 不轻松 休息了一阵之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:14.52,EN,,0,0,0,,super happy to be through and happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,能过关我非常高兴 也很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:15.54,EN,,0,0,0,,to be back in Toronto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到多伦多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.86,EN,,0,0,0,,and see you all tonight, it was amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚见到你们 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:21.74,EN,,0,0,0,,thank you, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:21.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 真的谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.10,EN,,0,0,0,,We love having you back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:24.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们也很高兴你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:25.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you about your break,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,想问问你的假期
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:27.82,EN,,0,0,0,,you went to Vienna with Ash,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,你带着阿什去了维也纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:29.64,EN,,0,0,0,,your Cavalier King Charles Spaniel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你那只查理王小猎犬
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:31.36,EN,,0,0,0,,with your fiancé Georgios,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有未婚夫乔治奥斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to have a little break from tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,离开网球休息一阵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:33.94,EN,,0,0,0,,are you feeling refreshed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:33.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在觉得恢复了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:34.46,EN,,0,0,0,,are you feeling ready
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:34.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,准备好迎接
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:35.82,EN,,0,0,0,,for the hard court season?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,硬地赛季了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I went to Vienna before Wimbledon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,温网之前我去了维也纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:40.02,EN,,0,0,0,,then I went to Mykonos after Wimbledon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:40.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,温网之后又去了米克诺斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:42.62,EN,,0,0,0,,so there was much needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是真的需要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:46.76,EN,,0,0,0,,there was so much needed, I feel refreshed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,太需要了 我觉得恢复了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:49.30,EN,,0,0,0,,recharged and ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,充满电 准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Great stuff, listen, your hard court record
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,太好了 你今年的硬地战绩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.92,EN,,0,0,0,,has been phenomenal this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,好得惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:55.58,EN,,0,0,0,,24 victories out of 25, do you feel you're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,二十五场赢了二十四场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:57.14,EN,,0,0,0,,your best here on the hard court,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:57.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,硬地上的你 是最好的自己吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.30,EN,,0,0,0,,are you feeling really comfortable playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到硬地打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:00:59.44,EN,,0,0,0,,back on the hard court?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:00:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得真的舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:01.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel definitely happy to be back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:01.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实很高兴 这个赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on hard court this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.32,0:01:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,能回到硬地
